<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I have a mouth to praise the Lord of grace;</l><l>I have a heart to love the Lord my God;</l><l>I give myself, all that I am and have</l><l>To always love and serve the Lord my God.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
